# The sandbox image receives only the immutable DeepSeek carrier inputs copied
# by .super-coder/Dockerfile. Keep the root context default-deny: parent
# exceptions permit traversal only, while the two scripts and governed asset
# tree below are the complete copyable surface.
*
!.super-coder
!.super-coder/scripts
!.super-coder/scripts/deepseek_runtime.py
!.super-coder/scripts/build_deepseek_carrier.py
!.super-coder/assets
!.super-coder/assets/deepseek
!.super-coder/assets/deepseek/**
